{"id":"85d54d65547349fa","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-consistency-strength.md","title":"Consistency Strength","display":"df-consistency-strength — Consistency Strength","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-consistency-strength","aliases":["72-df-consistency-strength"],"display":"df-consistency-strength — Consistency Strength","depends_on":["[[72-df-arithmetized-proof]]","[[72-df-two-sorted-derivability]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV ordinal/reductive analysis; explicit local consistency comparison","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"将固定呈现下的一致性强度预序性质写入断言"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-consistency-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-consistency-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-strength — Consistency Strength"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV ordinal/reductive analysis; explicit local consistency comparison"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"将固定呈现下的一致性强度预序性质写入断言"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}\">\\(\\iota\\in\\{1,2\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}\">\\(E\\supseteq E_{\\rm PR}\\)</span> 保持符号种类和元数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,T_1,T_2\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}\">\\(B,T_1,T_2\\subseteq\\mathsf S_{\\iota,E}\\)</span> 是有效可公理化理论；模式句集、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\">\\(\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}\">\\(\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c14656043bc77c1\" href=\"?note=4c14656043bc77c1\" title=\"72-df-arithmetized-proof\">72-df-arithmetized-proof</a>，其基础有限演算取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b63a805280ad1d8e\" href=\"?note=b63a805280ad1d8e\" title=\"72-df-two-sorted-derivability\">72-df-two-sorted-derivability</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_i\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T_i)\">\\(\\kappa_i\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T_i)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1,2\">\\(i=1,2\\)</span>，用于比较带编码的呈现。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa_i}(T_i)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa_i}(T_i)\\)</span> 是相应对象算术句；即使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_1=T_2\">\\(T_1=T_2\\)</span>，呈现中的两种编码也可不同。</li>\n<li>兼容的理论关系另固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T:=\\{T_1,T_2\\}\">\\(\\mathcal T:=\\{T_1,T_2\\}\\)</span> 与函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak k\">\\(\\mathfrak k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak k)=\\mathcal T\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak k)=\\mathcal T\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\ [\\mathfrak k(T)\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)]\">\\(\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\ [\\mathfrak k(T)\\in\\mathcal K_{\\iota,E}(T)]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\\in\\mathcal T\">\\(U,V\\in\\mathcal T\\)</span>。省略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota,\\mathfrak k\">\\(\\iota,\\mathfrak k\\)</span> 的记号只在它们固定后使用；相同理论经此函数必取相同呈现，不随关系出现的位置换码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle T_1,\\kappa_1\\rangle\\preceq_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota}\\langle T_2,\\kappa_2\\rangle\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ B\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\\bigl[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa_2}(T_2)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa_1}(T_1)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle T_1,\\kappa_1\\rangle\\preceq_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota}\\langle T_2,\\kappa_2\\rangle\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ B\\vdash_2^{(\\iota)}\\bigl[\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa_2}(T_2)\\to\\operatorname{Con}_{\\kappa_1}(T_1)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota,\\mathfrak k}V\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle U,\\mathfrak k(U)\\rangle\\preceq_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota}\\langle V,\\mathfrak k(V)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota,\\mathfrak k}V\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\langle U,\\mathfrak k(U)\\rangle\\preceq_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota}\\langle V,\\mathfrak k(V)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota,\\mathfrak k}V.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^{B,\\iota,\\mathfrak k}V.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U\\equiv_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\land V\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U\\equiv_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\land V\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\quad U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B U.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U\\in\\mathcal T\\quad U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B U.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall U,V,W\\in\\mathcal T\\quad\nU\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\land V\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B W\\Rightarrow U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B W.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall U,V,W\\in\\mathcal T\\quad\nU\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B V\\land V\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B W\\Rightarrow U\\le_{\\operatorname{Con}}^B W.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>比较方向仍是：在B中，后一呈现的一致性推出前一呈现的一致性。把证明模式与检查器显式列为参数，避免“同一个理论”却在不同检查程序之间静默换用Con句。固定呈现后，原关系及其自反、传递性质保留。序数相等或检查器仅在标准自然数上同扩张，均不自动给出B内的一致性等价。</p>\n<p>本轮扩充复核：固定函数 𝔨 保证同一理论每次取同一 Con 句；反身性由 A→A，传递性由两个蕴涵的命题合成。若随位置换码，这个证明不能无条件套用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-arithmetized-proof","status":"resolved","id":"